<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 101,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 101,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Friday's actual 101,000 and Saturday's 16,00 head at interior Iowa Minnesota. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts traded steady to weak compared with mid-session Friday.</p>
<p>Top $57.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>			   County		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    54.50 -55.50	   55.50 -56.50</p>
<p>few			54.00  56.00	   55.00  57.00</p>
<p>one interest bidding	  53.50		    54.50</p>
<p>Sows - mostly steady. Top $49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  42.00 -44.00	   42.00 -44.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   43.00 -46.00	   43.00 -46.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    45.00 -48.00	   46.00 -49.00</p>
